# Google Maps JavaScript API Key
# 1. Obtain an API Key from Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API", "Geocoding API", and "Places API"
# 3. For security, apply Application Restriction: HTTP referrers (e.g., http://localhost:5173/*, http://127.0.0.1:5173/*)
# 4. Copy this file to .env and set your key:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY_HERE

# Backend API Base URL (Optional - defaults to auto-detected host:8000)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
